        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "controlled_comparison",
      "statement": "In controlled reproduction, the original condition kept the MCP request on connect_mcp with only a platform connection available and failed with 401; the corrected condition used a connect_mcp Sheets connection and succeeded with 200, isolating connection-surface configuration as the discriminating variable.",
